MODULE parity.syntax.keywordcasedecl.

Use lib.alpha VERSION 2 AS Alpha.
use lib.beta Version 3 As Beta.

Define Account WITH id AS Text and balance As Int.
DEFINE Ledger HAS owner aS Text, entries AS List Of Int.
Define Given With major AS Int.
Define Status AS ONE OF Open, Closed.

Type Money AS Int.

Rule total GIVEN items AS List OF Int, PRODUCE Int:
  Return 0.

Rule make GIVEN a As Account Produce Account:
  Return Account With id set to a.id, balance set to a.balance.

Rule wrap gIVEN v AS Int, Produce Result Of Int and Text. IT PERFORMS io:
  Return ok OF v.

Rule pick Given g AS Given, pRODUCE Int:
  Let f be function With x aS Int, PRODUCE Int: Return x.
  Return f(g.major).
